*.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
global-bundle.pem

#####Important Terraform Concepts Used#####
Terraform Concept	Meaning
map	Key-value structure
object	Structured configuration
for_each	Dynamic resource creation
each.key	Current map key
each.value	Current map value
list(string)	List of strings
map(string)	Key-value string map